    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2BwDJuqNETEyCwswgX8zTyT)_\n\n## What\n\n- `sp-litnotes-meta-backfill-all-children` already inserted a `collection-query-table` block for a book or collection; it now also picks the right view for a reference work or an encyclopedia (by the BibTeX type tag, `sp-litnotes-meta-parent-views`).\n- New command `M-x sp-litnotes-meta-refresh-all-tables` refreshes every chapter table in the vault in one go:\n  - Syncs the Vulpea database first (`sp-litnotes-meta-refresh-sync`), since the DB can lag.\n  - Parents are found from the chapters: every `bib-parent` of a note tagged `booksection`, `incollection`, `inreference` or `encyclopedia`. So an encyclopedia article whose parent is tagged `encyclopedia` or `collection` gets its table in either case.\n  - A parent without a block gets one above its first heading; a tagged note with no chapters and no block is left alone.\n  - `C-u` is a dry run. A summary buffer lists tables added, changed, unchanged, failures, and `bib-parent` ids missing from the database.\n- New built-in views `reference-entries` and `encyclopedia-articles` (sorted by title; entries have no pages).\n- `sp-bibtex-types-tag-alist` now maps `inreference`, `reference`, `mvreference`.\n- `sp-collec-query-check-rules` takes a list of parent tags per child tag, with rules for `inreference` (reference or book) and `encyclopedia` (encyclopedia or collection), so the `:check` column does not flag them.\n\n## Assumptions to confirm\n\n- A reference manual is tagged `reference` (or `book`) and its entries `inreference`; an encyclopedia is tagged `encyclopedia`. All configurable via the options above.\n\n## Tests\n\n- New ERT tests (Emacs 29.3): check rules, and refresh-all with stubbed Vulpea (dry run, insert, update, missing parent, second run unchanged). All 56 litnotes-meta and 32 query-table tests pass.\n- Not run on the real vault. Docs are in `sp-litnotes-meta.org`; `.el` files re-tangled from the docs.\n- CHANGELOG not edited (nightly tidy writes it).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiDSHDEGNJxmSPXp8cZ)_",
